 JSON in, JSON out. Routes are listed in `README.md`.

+## Authentication and roles
+
+Every request must carry `Authorization: Bearer <key>` matching an entry in
+`apiKeys`. Missing or unknown keys return `401` (`unauthorized`); known keys
+without permission return `403` (`forbidden`).
+
+- `viewer`: read-only (`GET` routes except `GET /audit`).
+- `cook`: everything `viewer` can do, plus `POST /recipes/:id/cook`,
+  `POST /batches/:id/waste`, `POST /temperatures` and
+  `POST /stocktakes/:id/counts`.
+- `manager`: every route, including `GET /audit` (audit entries, newest first).
+
 ## Errors

 Errors have a status from `src/errors.js` and the body
